    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;The deep remembers. You&rsquo;re how it talks.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>Tide Recall.</strong> 1/Soma Break: touch a thing &mdash; surface, object, creature. The GM gives you one true detail from its recent past (see your heritage window). You may spend <strong>1 Surge</strong> to push the window one tier beyond your current (e.g. at Tier 1 you see 24h; with a Surge, one week). You cannot push beyond Tier 4&rsquo;s &ldquo;any time.&rdquo;</p>",
